					type: "checkmark"
				}
			]
			x: 7.0d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The wireless network here has been established from the moment you enter the archive, and has&dunlimited capacity &r,&bwithout energy loss &r, and can even&6transmit power across latitudes &r"
				""
				"It can interact with the wireless network through the wireless energy covering board, wireless energy/power bin, wireless laser target/source bin, wireless energy interface and power generation array"
				""
				"Wireless energy monitor can monitor the specifics of wireless networks"
			]
